<title>ITALY: Italy tax revenue Jan-May 1997 200.279 trln lire.</title>
<headline>Italy tax revenue Jan-May 1997 200.279 trln lire.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Finance Ministry said on Monday that Italy's tax revenue for the first five months of 1997 totalled 200.279 trillion lire, unchanged from the same period a year earlier.  </p>
<p>The Finance Ministry said in a statement the tax income for the month of May was 49.726 trillion lire, down 3.168 trillion or six percent on May 1996.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
